    "detailed_description": "<strong>World's greatest collection game.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Enter the world of ball:</strong><br><br>Get crate drops every three hours! Open crates and collect unique balls of five different rarity levels.<br><br><strong>(NEW)Arcade</strong>: Equip your favorite skin and play games!<br>Bally Bird (Iconic remake of a very popular game you might recognize)<br><br><br><strong>Future plans:</strong><br><br>Ball is in its early stages. Here's what's on the way:<br><strong>Content updates</strong>: not only new balls and crates for you to collect and enjoy, but also some extra features we think you will like...<br><strong>Steam community integration and supporting the artists</strong>: we want to see what you can create. submit your work and have a chance to be featured in a &quot;community crate&quot;!<br><strong>More arcade games and ways to utilize your balls</strong>: ball is not just another low quality collection game. items will be usable in titles we have planned for the future.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>World's greatest collection game.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Enter the world of ball:</strong><br><br>Get crate drops every three hours! Open crates and collect unique balls of five different rarity levels.<br><br><strong>(NEW)Arcade</strong>: Equip your favorite skin and play games!<br>Bally Bird (Iconic remake of a very popular game you might recognize)<br><br><br><strong>Future plans:</strong><br><br>Ball is in its early stages. Here's what's on the way:<br><strong>Content updates</strong>: not only new balls and crates for you to collect and enjoy, but also some extra features we think you will like...<br><strong>Steam community integration and supporting the artists</strong>: we want to see what you can create. submit your work and have a chance to be featured in a &quot;community crate&quot;!<br><strong>More arcade games and ways to utilize your balls</strong>: ball is not just another low quality collection game. items will be usable in titles we have planned for the future.",
